---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full bg-elan-dark text-white/80 py-16 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold tracking-[4px] text-white block mb-4">
          ÉLAN
        </span>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/60 font-light max-w-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Estética avançada e terapias de bem-estar focadas em harmonia, saúde e respeito à sua individualidade.
        </p>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-sans text-elan-nude tracking-wider uppercase">
          CRM-SP 123.456 • RQE 78.910
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-white mb-4">
          Navegação
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-white/70 font-light">
          <li><a href="#tratamentos" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tratamentos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#clinica" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">A clínica</a></li>
          <li><a href="#equipe" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Corpo clínico</a></li>
          <li><a href="#depoimentos" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Depoimentos</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact & Hours -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-white mb-4">
          Atendimento
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/70 font-light leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Segunda a Sexta: 08h às 20h<br />
          Sábados: 09h às 15h
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-light">
          Alameda dos Aromas, 420 — Jardins<br />
          São Paulo, SP
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-white/50 font-light gap-4">
      <p>© {currentYear} Élan Estética Integrada. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex space-x-6">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacidade</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Termos de Uso</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
